- combat_actor.gd:47 _HELD_BLEND_S := 0.12 (the grab's blend into 'held', also the ragdoll_stop floor at 485);
- combat_actor.gd:48 _GRAB_EASE_S := 0.23 (the pin ease);
- combat_actor.gd:983 rig.play(_directional_anim(&"stagger", kb), 0.04).
reaction_snap_blend_s's doc (tuning_data.gd:81-83) lists the launch, knee jolt, flinch and guard break, so tuning the snap leaves the stagger's snap behind at 0.04.
The rest of the new literals are technical or art: tie margins (0.001, 0.0001, the 0.01 side bias), VfxDirector.WARM_* (documented as technical), pose angles, Hair dimensions, the player's pants_color (an art color, like body_color). Pre-existing: _PANTS_DARKEN, the `else 12` hitstun fallback.
